sequenceDiagram
  participant F as EntityCard
  participant R as PUT /entities
  participant D as save_video_entities
  F->>F: entityProblems (longer than max_entities?)
  F->>R: entities, version
  R->>R: version = currentVersion("E"); too long -> 422 too_many_entities
  R->>D: rpc(version = E.v5)
  D->>D: lock assignment; too long -> raise too_many_entities
  D-->>R: saved E answer
